@startuml
title Expense Lifecycle (Both scopes; proposed state machine)

[*] --> PENDING_REVIEW : valid submission committed
PENDING_REVIEW --> PENDING_REVIEW : approval recorded; more approvals required
PENDING_REVIEW --> REJECTED : authorized reviewer rejects
PENDING_REVIEW --> APPROVED : all approvals complete;\nledger posting committed atomically
APPROVED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]

note right of PENDING_REVIEW
  Pending expenses are not in approved history
  and have no balance/ledger effect.
end note
note right of APPROVED
  Approved means the final decision and
  ledger posting committed exactly once.
end note
note right of REJECTED
  Rejected expenses do not affect balances.
  Edit/resubmit behavior is an open decision.
end note
@enduml
